# chorus golden vector: output delay, protocol v2 message type 0x14.
#
# Committed, and never written by a test. Any implementation of chorus protocol v2 must
# produce these exact bytes from the canonical input in output_delay.fields, and recover
# exactly those fields from them (docs/protocol.md, "Version 2").
#
# Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# frame header: type 0x14, payload length 8 (0x0008), big-endian
14 00 08

# delay_ns = 12500000 (12.5 ms added before playout)
00 00 00 00 00 BE BC 20
